OL,3,GNEWSAWales falls silent with
OL,4,ARemembrance services across the country
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing Remembrance Sunday services
OL,7,Faround the UK, there will be further
OL,8,Fevents on Armistice Day on 11 November
OL,9,F- when the traditional two-minute
OL,10,Fsilence will be observed at 11:00 GMT.
